<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Default feeds for indefinite-articles. Every URL was checked to be working and active on 2026-11-03
     (the Podcasts category on 2026-11-05, feeds added to thinly covered countries, History, Cities & Transport
     and Podcasts on 2026-11-06; a few low-volume country feeds post less than monthly).
     Sites whose articles are mostly behind a hard or strict metered paywall are left out.
     Delete lines (or whole categories) you never want; add your own feeds here or in another
     .opml/.txt file in this directory. You can also exclude categories in indefinite-articles.toml:
       exclude_categories = ["Sports", "Gaming"]
     maxItems limits how many entries are taken from each fetch of very busy feeds. -->
